INSERT INTO `wp_posts` VALUES (3,1,'2026-10-15 05:48:40','2026-10-15 05:48:40','<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Who we are</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong class=\"privacy-policy-tutorial\">Suggested text: </strong>Our website address is: https://indogrills.com.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Comments</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong class=\"privacy-policy-tutorial\">Suggested text: </strong>When visitors leave comments on the site we collect the data shown in the comments form, and also the visitor&#8217;s IP address and browser user agent string to help spam detection.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>An anonymized string created from your email address (also called a hash) may be provided to the Gravatar service to see if you are using it. The Gravatar service privacy policy is available here: https://automattic.com/privacy/. After approval of your comment, your profile picture is visible to the public in the context of your comment.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Media</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong class=\"privacy-policy-tutorial\">Suggested text: </strong>If you upload images to the website, you should avoid uploading images with embedded location data (EXIF GPS) included. Visitors to the website can download and extract any location data from images on the website.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Cookies</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong class=\"privacy-policy-tutorial\">Suggested text: </strong>If you leave a comment on our site you may opt-in to saving your name, email address and website in cookies. These are for your convenience so that you do not have to fill in your details again when you leave another comment. These cookies will last for one year.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>If you visit our login page, we will set a temporary cookie to determine if your browser accepts cookies. This cookie contains no personal data and is discarded when you close your browser.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>When you log in, we will also set up several cookies to save your login information and your screen display choices. Login cookies last for two days, and screen options cookies last for a year. If you select &quot;Remember Me&quot;, your login will persist for two weeks. If you log out of your account, the login cookies will be removed.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>If you edit or publish an article, an additional cookie will be saved in your browser. This cookie includes no personal data and simply indicates the post ID of the article you just edited. It expires after 1 day.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Embedded content from other websites</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong class=\"privacy-policy-tutorial\">Suggested text: </strong>Articles on this site may include embedded content (e.g. videos, images, articles, etc.). Embedded content from other websites behaves in the exact same way as if the visitor has visited the other website.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>These websites may collect data about you, use cookies, embed additional third-party tracking, and monitor your interaction with that embedded content, including tracking your interaction with the embedded content if you have an account and are logged in to that website.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Who we share your data with</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong class=\"privacy-policy-tutorial\">Suggested text: </strong>If you request a password reset, your IP address will be included in the reset email.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">How long we retain your data</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong class=\"privacy-policy-tutorial\">Suggested text: </strong>If you leave a comment, the comment and its metadata are retained indefinitely. This is so we can recognize and approve any follow-up comments automatically instead of holding them in a moderation queue.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>For users that register on our website (if any), we also store the personal information they provide in their user profile. All users can see, edit, or delete their personal information at any time (except they cannot change their username). Website administrators can also see and edit that information.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">What rights you have over your data</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong class=\"privacy-policy-tutorial\">Suggested text: </strong>If you have an account on this site, or have left comments, you can request to receive an exported file of the personal data we hold about you, including any data you have provided to us. You can also request that we erase any personal data we hold about you. This does not include any data we are obliged to keep for administrative, legal, or security purposes.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Where your data is sent</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong class=\"privacy-policy-tutorial\">Suggested text: </strong>Visitor comments may be checked through an automated spam detection service.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n','Privacy Policy','','draft','closed','open','','privacy-policy','','','2026-10-15 05:48:40','2026-10-15 05:48:40','',0,'https://indogrills.com/?page_id=3',0,'page','',0),(4,0,'2026-10-15 05:48:40','2026-10-15 05:48:40','<!-- wp:page-list /-->','Navigation','','publish','closed','closed','','navigation','','','2026-10-15 05:48:40','2026-10-15 05:48:40','',0,'https://indogrills.com/index.php/2026/10/15/navigation/',0,'wp_navigation','',0),(5,0,'2026-10-15 05:49:56','2026-10-15 05:49:56','','Home','','publish','closed','closed','','home','','','2026-10-15 05:49:56','2026-10-15 05:49:56','',0,'https://indogrills.com/home/',0,'page','',0),(6,0,'2026-10-15 05:49:56','2026-10-15 05:49:56','<div class=\"about-intro\"><span class=\"eyebrow dark\">About IndoGrills</span><h2>Manufacturing air distribution products for over 10 years</h2><p class=\"lead-text\">IndoGrills is a manufacturer of AC grills and air distribution products. With more than a decade of experience in the HVAC industry, we supply grills, diffusers, dampers, disk valves, jet nozzles and louvers to contractors, MEP consultants, builders and distributors.</p></div>\n<div class=\"about-stats\"><div><b>10+</b><span>Years of experience</span></div><div><b>50+</b><span>Products in our range</span></div><div><b>7</b><span>Product categories</span></div><div><b>100%</b><span>Made to order sizes</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"about-two\"><div><h2>Our Story</h2><p>IndoGrills began with a simple goal: to give HVAC contractors a dependable source for well-finished grills and diffusers, made to the size on the drawing and delivered when promised.</p><p>Over the last 10+ years we have grown from a small fabrication workshop into a manufacturer that supplies residential towers, commercial offices, hospitals, factories and retail spaces. Our growth has come from repeat customers, and we have kept the same approach throughout: accurate sizes, clean finishing and honest communication.</p></div><div class=\"about-card\"><h3>At a glance</h3><ul class=\"ticks\"><li>10+ years in HVAC air distribution</li><li>Custom sizes, materials and finishes</li><li>Single orders to large project supply</li><li>Powder coat, anodised and mill finishes</li><li>Direct technical support from enquiry to delivery</li></ul></div></div>\n<h2>What We Manufacture</h2><p>Our range covers the products needed to distribute and control air in a ducted air-conditioning or ventilation system:</p>\n<div class=\"about-list\"><div><h3>Grills</h3><p>Return air, supply air, linear, stripline, double deflection, door grills and more.</p></div><div><h3>Diffusers</h3><p>Slot, round, square, tile and four-way diffusers in aluminium and stainless steel.</p></div><div><h3>Dampers</h3><p>Volume control, collar, gravity, round, capsule, butterfly and motorised dampers.</p></div><div><h3>Disk Valves</h3><p>Metal and plastic disk valves for exhaust and supply in toilets and small rooms.</p></div><div><h3>Jet Nozzles &amp; Louvers</h3><p>Long-throw jet nozzles and weather louvers for halls, plant rooms and facades.</p></div><div><h3>Special Items</h3><p>Fire and smoke panels, HEPA boxes, reducers, risers and grill doors.</p></div></div>\n<h2>Why Choose IndoGrills</h2>\n<div class=\"values\"><div><i>1</i><h3>Made to Your Size</h3><p>Every grill is made to the dimensions in your drawing, not forced into a standard size.</p></div><div><i>2</i><h3>Quality Finishing</h3><p>Powder coating, anodising and mill finish with consistent colour and clean edges.</p></div><div><i>3</i><h3>On-Time Delivery</h3><p>Planned production and dispatch so your site schedule does not slip.</p></div><div><i>4</i><h3>Responsive Support</h3><p>A team that answers calls, understands drawings and sorts out issues quickly.</p></div></div>\n<h2>Supply &amp; Delivery</h2><p>We supply single pieces as well as full project quantities to contractors, consultants and distributors. Send us your requirements and we will confirm sizes, finishes, lead time and delivery options for your location.</p>\n<div class=\"about-cta\"><h2>Let\'s discuss your project</h2><p>Share your sizes, quantity and finish and we will respond with a quotation.</p><a class=\"btn\" href=\"https://indogrills.com/contact/\">Request a Quote</a> <a class=\"btn alt-dark\" href=\"https://indogrills.com/products/\">Browse Products</a></div>','About Us','IndoGrills is a manufacturer of AC grills, diffusers, dampers and HVAC air distribution products with 10+ years of experience. Custom sizes and bulk supply.','publish','closed','closed','','about','','','2026-10-15 06:56:57','2026-10-15 06:56:57','',0,'https://indogrills.com/about/',0,'page','',0),(7,0,'2026-10-15 05:49:56','2026-10-15 05:49:56','','Contact','Request a quote for AC grills, diffusers, dampers and HVAC air distribution products from IndoGrills. Share your sizes, quantity and finish and we will respond.','publish','closed','closed','','contact','','','2026-10-15 06:50:24','2026-10-15 06:50:24','',0,'https://indogrills.com/contact/',0,'page','',0),(12,0,'2026-10-15 05:59:57','2026-10-15 05:59:57','The volume control damper (VCD) is fitted inside ductwork to regulate and balance airflow to each branch of an air-conditioning system. Adjustable blades with a locking lever let installers set the required air volume accurately. We manufacture VCDs to your duct size in GI or aluminium.','VCD','Volume control damper (VCD) for balancing airflow in ducts','publish','closed','closed','','vcd','','','2026-10-15 06:44:16','2026-10-15 06:44:16','',0,'https://indogrills.com/products/vcd/',0,'product','',0),(13,0,'2026-10-15 05:59:57','2026-10-15 05:59:57','The collar damper is fitted at the take-off of a branch duct or behind a grill to control the volume of air entering it. It makes commissioning and balancing quick and keeps airflow even across outlets. Available in sizes to match your grill or duct collar.','Collar Damper','Collar damper for branch duct airflow control','publish','closed','closed','','collar-damper','','','2026-10-15 06:44:16','2026-10-15 06:44:16','',0,'https://indogrills.com/products/collar-damper/',1,'product','',0),(14,0,'2026-10-15 05:59:57','2026-10-15 05:59:57','The stripline grill has fine, closely spaced slats that give a sleek, architectural finish on walls and ceilings. It suits offices, showrooms and hospitality interiors where the grill should blend in. Made to your size in aluminium with powder-coated or anodised finish.','Stripline Grill','Stripline grill with fine slats for a clean, modern look','publish','closed','closed','','stripline-grill','','','2026-10-15 06:44:16','2026-10-15 06:44:16','',0,'https://indogrills.com/products/stripline-grill/',2,'product','',0),(15,0,'2026-10-15 05:59:57','2026-10-15 05:59:57','The three slot diffuser delivers supply air in a long, even pattern along ceilings and bulkheads, giving comfortable air distribution without draughts. It has a 5 inch inner size and is made in aluminium with a clean white or custom finish. Lengths are made to order.','3 Slot Diffuser','Three slot linear diffuser, 5 inch inner size','publish','closed','closed','','3-slot-diffuser','','','2026-10-15 06:44:16','2026-10-15 06:44:16','',0,'https://indogrills.com/products/3-slot-diffuser/',3,'product','',0),(16,0,'2026-10-15 05:59:57','2026-10-15 05:59:57','The two slot diffuser is a slim linear diffuser for false ceilings in offices, retail and hospitality spaces. It spreads supply air evenly along its length and sits neatly in the ceiling grid. Available in custom lengths and finishes.','Two Slot Diffuser','Two slot linear ceiling diffuser','publish','closed','closed','','two-slot-diffuser','','','2026-10-15 06:44:16','2026-10-15 06:44:16','',0,'https://indogrills.com/products/two-slot-diffuser/',4,'product','',0),(17,0,'2026-10-15 05:59:57','2026-10-15 05:59:57','The single deflection grill has one set of adjustable horizontal blades that direct supply air where it is needed. It is a dependable choice for walls, ducts and sidewall outlets in homes and commercial buildings. Made to order in aluminium in standard and RAL colours.','Single Deflection Grill','Single deflection supply air grill with adjustable blades','publish','closed','closed','','single-deflection-grill','','','2026-10-15 06:44:16','2026-10-15 06:44:16','',0,'https://indogrills.com/products/single-deflection-grill/',5,'product','',0),(18,0,'2026-10-15 05:59:57','2026-10-15 05:59:57','The jet nozzle projects air over long distances and can be swivelled to aim the airflow, which suits large halls and high ceilings. This model has a 200 mm return diameter. Made in aluminium with a durable finish.','Jet Nozzle (Return Dia 200)','Jet nozzle with 200 mm return diameter for long-throw air','publish','closed','closed','','jet-nozzle-return-dia-200','','','2026-10-15 06:44:16','2026-10-15 06:44:16','',0,'https://indogrills.com/products/jet-nozzle-return-dia-200/',6,'product','',0),(19,0,'2026-10-15 05:59:57','2026-10-15 05:59:57','The AC round diffuser distributes supply air in a smooth circular pattern from the ceiling. Its 250 mm diameter suits offices, shops and living areas, and the concentric cones give a neat, modern look. Made in aluminium with powder-coated finish.','Round Diffuser','AC round diffuser, 250 mm diameter','publish','closed','closed','','round-diffuser','','','2026-10-15 06:44:16','2026-10-15 06:44:16','',0,'https://indogrills.com/products/round-diffuser/',7,'product','',0),(20,0,'2026-10-15 05:59:57','2026-10-15 05:59:57','This 5Nm on/off actuator motor opens and closes motorised dampers automatically as part of an HVAC or fire control system. It is supplied for use with our motorised and volume control dampers. Contact us to confirm model and availability.','Belimo 5Nm On/Off Motor','5Nm on/off actuator motor for motorised dampers','publish','closed','closed','','belimo-5nm-on-off-motor','','','2026-10-15 06:44:16','2026-10-15 06:44:16','',0,'https://indogrills.com/products/belimo-5nm-on-off-motor/',8,'product','',0),(21,0,'2026-10-15 05:59:57','2026-10-15 05:59:57','The 1 inch flange main grill is a supply or return grill with a neat 1 inch border and an integrated collar damper for volume control. It is widely used on main ducts and wall openings. Made to your size in aluminium with powder coating.','1 Inch Flange Main Grill','1 inch flange main grill with collar damper','publish','closed','closed','','1-inch-flange-main-grill','','','2026-10-15 06:44:16','2026-10-15 06:44:16','',0,'https://indogrills.com/products/1-inch-flange-main-grill/',9,'product','',0),(22,0,'2026-10-15 05:59:57','2026-10-15 05:59:57','Our GI riser is a rigid galvanised iron section with powder-coated finish used to carry air vertically through a building. It is fabricated to your drawing and sold by weight. Suitable for ducting runs in commercial and residential projects.','Riser','GI riser with powder coating, rate per kg','publish','closed','closed','','riser','','','2026-10-15 06:44:16','2026-10-15 06:44:16','',0,'https://indogrills.com/products/riser/',10,'product','',0),(23,0,'2026-10-15 05:59:57','2026-10-15 05:59:57','The door grill allows air to pass through a door for return air or ventilation. It has a 1 inch flange on the front and a back side frame for a secure, tidy fit. Made to door cut-out sizes in aluminium or steel.','Door Grill','Door grill, 1 inch flange with back side frame','publish','closed','closed','','door-grill','','','2026-10-15 06:44:16','2026-10-15 06:44:16','',0,'https://indogrills.com/products/door-grill/',11,'product','',0),(24,0,'2026-10-15 05:59:57','2026-10-15 05:59:57','The square shape diffuser delivers supply air evenly in all directions from a false ceiling. It has a 4 inch return neck and a clean, modern profile that suits offices and homes. Made in aluminium with a white or custom finish.','Square Shape Diffuser','Square ceiling diffuser, 4 inch return neck size','publish','closed','closed','','square-shape-diffuser','','','2026-10-15 06:44:16','2026-10-15 06:44:16','',0,'https://indogrills.com/products/square-shape-diffuser/',12,'product','',0),(25,0,'2026-10-15 05:59:57','2026-10-15 05:59:57','The 6 x 6 inch four side grill is a compact grill with a frame on all four sides for use at small outlets and returns. It is easy to fit and finishes the opening neatly. Available in aluminium with powder-coated finish.','6\" x 6\" Four Side Grill','6 x 6 inch four side grill','publish','closed','closed','','6-x-6-four-side-grill','','','2026-10-15 06:44:16','2026-10-15 06:44:16','',0,'https://indogrills.com/products/6-x-6-four-side-grill/',13,'product','',0),(26,0,'2026-10-15 05:59:58','2026-10-15 05:59:58','The 6 inch jet nozzle is a smaller long-throw nozzle used to direct air precisely in showrooms, halls and industrial spaces. It can be adjusted to aim airflow where required. Made in aluminium with durable finish.','Jet Nozzle (Return Dia 6 inch)','Jet nozzle with 6 inch return diameter','publish','closed','closed','','jet-nozzle-return-dia-6-inch','','','2026-10-15 06:44:16','2026-10-15 06:44:16','',0,'https://indogrills.com/products/jet-nozzle-return-dia-6-inch/',14,'product','',0),(27,0,'2026-10-15 05:59:58','2026-10-15 05:59:58','The 200 x 100 mm four side grill is a compact rectangular grill used for return or supply openings in small ducts and walls. Its four-side frame gives a neat edge. Made in aluminium in standard and custom colours.','200 x 100 Four Side Grill','200 x 100 mm four side grill','publish','closed','closed','','200-x-100-four-side-grill','','','2026-10-15 06:44:16','2026-10-15 06:44:16','',0,'https://indogrills.com/products/200-x-100-four-side-grill/',15,'product','',0),(28,0,'2026-10-15 05:59:58','2026-10-15 05:59:58','The tile diffuser fits a standard 600 x 600 mm false-ceiling grid and distributes supply air evenly across the room. It has a 450 x 450 mm neck and a 595 x 595 mm outer size for a flush finish. Made in aluminium with powder coating.','Tiles Diffuser','Tile diffuser, neck 450 x 450 mm, outer 595 x 595 mm','publish','closed','closed','','tiles-diffuser','','','2026-10-15 06:44:16','2026-10-15 06:44:16','',0,'https://indogrills.com/products/tiles-diffuser/',16,'product','',0),(29,0,'2026-10-15 05:59:58','2026-10-15 05:59:58','The round duct damper controls airflow inside circular ducts by turning an internal blade, set with an external handle. This size is approximately 250 mm diameter. Made in GI for durability.','Round Duct Damper','Round duct damper, approx. 250 mm diameter','publish','closed','closed','','round-duct-damper','','','2026-10-15 06:44:16','2026-10-15 06:44:16','',0,'https://indogrills.com/products/round-duct-damper/',17,'product','',0),(30,0,'2026-10-15 05:59:58','2026-10-15 05:59:58','The four way diffuser throws air in four directions for even coverage in the centre of a room. The grill-type design gives a clean look in offices and showrooms. Special sizes and requirements are available on request.','Four Way Diffuser Grill Type','Four way grill-type diffuser for ceilings','publish','closed','closed','','four-way-diffuser-grill-type','','','2026-10-15 06:44:16','2026-10-15 06:44:16','',0,'https://indogrills.com/products/four-way-diffuser-grill-type/',18,'product','',0),(31,0,'2026-10-15 05:59:58','2026-10-15 05:59:58','The double deflection grill has horizontal and vertical blade sets so you can steer air both up-down and left-right. It is used for supply air where precise direction and spread are needed. Made in aluminium to your size.','Double Deflection Grill','Double deflection grill with two sets of adjustable blades','publish','closed','closed','','double-deflection-grill','','','2026-10-15 06:44:16','2026-10-15 06:44:16','',0,'https://indogrills.com/products/double-deflection-grill/',19,'product','',0),(32,0,'2026-10-15 05:59:58','2026-10-15 05:59:58','This premium double deflection grill uses heavier sections and a smoother finish for a more robust, refined result. Two sets of adjustable blades give full control over airflow direction. Ideal for offices, hotels and high-end residential projects.','Double Deflection Grill - Premium','Premium quality double deflection grill','publish','closed','closed','','double-deflection-grill-premium','','','2026-10-15 06:44:16','2026-10-15 06:44:16','',0,'https://indogrills.com/products/double-deflection-grill-premium/',20,'product','',0),(33,0,'2026-10-15 05:59:58','2026-10-15 05:59:58','The linear grill has fixed slim blades angled at 15 or 45 degrees to guide air and screen the duct behind it. It is a popular choice for return air and supply on walls and ceilings. Made to size in aluminium.','Linear Grill 15° & 45°','Linear grill with 15 and 45 degree blade angle','publish','closed','closed','','linear-grill-15-45','','','2026-10-15 06:44:16','2026-10-15 06:44:16','',0,'https://indogrills.com/products/linear-grill-15-45/',21,'product','',0),(34,0,'2026-10-15 05:59:58','2026-10-15 05:59:58','The 0 degree linear grill has straight blades for maximum free area, which suits return air openings. Its clean horizontal lines suit modern interiors. Made to order in aluminium with powder coating.','Linear Grill 0°','Linear grill with 0 degree straight blades','publish','closed','closed','','linear-grill-0','','','2026-10-15 06:44:16','2026-10-15 06:44:16','',0,'https://indogrills.com/products/linear-grill-0/',22,'product','',0),(35,0,'2026-10-15 05:59:58','2026-10-15 05:59:58','The 56 degree grill uses angled fixed blades to give good visual screening and controlled airflow. It is used for return and transfer openings on walls and doors. Available in custom sizes and finishes.','56° Grill','56 degree grill with 15@21 blade angle','publish','closed','closed','','56-grill','','','2026-10-15 06:44:16','2026-10-15 06:44:16','',0,'https://indogrills.com/products/56-grill/',23,'product','',0),(36,0,'2026-10-15 05:59:58','2026-10-15 05:59:58','We make jet nozzles in a full range of sizes for halls, atriums and large open spaces. Each nozzle is adjustable so air can be aimed accurately over a long throw. Contact us with your required diameter and quantity.','Jet Nozzle - All Sizes','Jet nozzle available in all sizes','publish','closed','closed','','jet-nozzle-all-sizes','','','2026-10-15 06:44:16','2026-10-15 06:44:16','',0,'https://indogrills.com/products/jet-nozzle-all-sizes/',24,'product','',0),(37,0,'2026-10-15 05:59:58','2026-10-15 05:59:58','The standard double deflection grill has two sets of adjustable blades for flexible air direction. It is a cost-effective option for supply outlets in ducted systems. Made in aluminium to your size.','Double Deflection','Double deflection grill, standard model','publish','closed','closed','','double-deflection','','','2026-10-15 06:44:16','2026-10-15 06:44:16','',0,'https://indogrills.com/products/double-deflection/',25,'product','',0),(38,0,'2026-10-15 05:59:58','2026-10-15 05:59:58','The fire and smoke panel is used to close or protect duct and ceiling openings as part of a building fire safety arrangement. It is made to your required size. Please share your specification so we can confirm suitability.','Fire Smoke Panel','Fire and smoke panel for ducting and openings','publish','closed','closed','','fire-smoke-panel','','','2026-10-15 06:44:16','2026-10-15 06:44:16','',0,'https://indogrills.com/products/fire-smoke-panel/',26,'product','',0),(39,0,'2026-10-15 05:59:58','2026-10-15 05:59:58','The tile grill is an egg-crate style grill with a cellular grid that gives high free area and a clean look. It is used for return air in false ceilings and lights. Made in aluminium with a white or custom finish.','Tiles Grill','Egg-crate tile grill for 600 x 600 ceiling grids','publish','closed','closed','','tiles-grill','','','2026-10-15 06:44:16','2026-10-15 06:44:16','',0,'https://indogrills.com/products/tiles-grill/',27,'product','',0),(40,0,'2026-10-15 05:59:58','2026-10-15 05:59:58','The four ways grill directs air in four directions from a ceiling outlet for even coverage. It has a neat square frame and suits offices, shops and homes. Made in aluminium to your size.','Four Ways Grill','Four way grill for ceiling supply','publish','closed','closed','','four-ways-grill','','','2026-10-15 06:44:16','2026-10-15 06:44:16','',0,'https://indogrills.com/products/fo