s.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/capsule-duct-damper-d.png',0,'attachment','image/png',0),(212,0,'2026-10-15 06:37:26','2026-10-15 06:37:26','','Butterfly Damper with Ring - angled view','','inherit','open','closed','','butterfly-damper-with-ring-angled-view','','','2026-10-15 06:37:26','2026-10-15 06:37:26','',61,'https://indogrills.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/butterfly-damper-with-ring-a.png',0,'attachment','image/png',0),(213,0,'2026-10-15 06:37:26','2026-10-15 06:37:26','','Butterfly Damper with Ring - detail','','inherit','open','closed','','butterfly-damper-with-ring-detail','','','2026-10-15 06:37:26','2026-10-15 06:37:26','',61,'https://indogrills.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/butterfly-damper-with-ring-d.png',0,'attachment','image/png',0),(214,0,'2026-10-15 06:37:26','2026-10-15 06:37:26','','Reducer - angled view','','inherit','open','closed','','reducer-angled-view','','','2026-10-15 06:37:26','2026-10-15 06:37:26','',62,'https://indogrills.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/reducer-a.png',0,'attachment','image/png',0),(215,0,'2026-10-15 06:37:26','2026-10-15 06:37:26','','Reducer - detail','','inherit','open','closed','','reducer-detail','','','2026-10-15 06:37:26','2026-10-15 06:37:26','',62,'https://indogrills.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/reducer-d.png',0,'attachment','image/png',0),(216,0,'2026-10-15 06:42:43','2026-10-15 06:42:43','<div class=\"about-intro\"><span class=\"eyebrow dark\">About IndoGrills</span><h2>Manufacturing air distribution products in Mumbai for over 10 years</h2><p class=\"lead-text\">IndoGrills is a Mumbai-based manufacturer of AC grills and air distribution products. With more than a decade of experience in the HVAC industry, we supply grills, diffusers, dampers, disk valves, jet nozzles and louvers to contractors, MEP consultants, builders and distributors.</p></div>\n<div class=\"about-stats\"><div><b>10+</b><span>Years of experience</span></div><div><b>Mumbai</b><span>Based manufacturer</span></div><div><b>50+</b><span>Products in our range</span></div><div><b>100%</b><span>Made to order sizes</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"about-two\"><div><h2>Our Story</h2><p>IndoGrills began with a simple goal: to give HVAC contractors in Mumbai a dependable local source for well-finished grills and diffusers, made to the size on the drawing and delivered when promised.</p><p>Over the last 10+ years we have grown from a small fabrication workshop into a manufacturer that supplies residential towers, commercial offices, hospitals, factories and retail spaces across the Mumbai region. Our growth has come from repeat customers, and we have kept the same approach throughout: accurate sizes, clean finishing and honest communication.</p></div><div class=\"about-card\"><h3>At a glance</h3><ul class=\"ticks\"><li>Based in the Mumbai area, Maharashtra</li><li>10+ years in HVAC air distribution</li><li>Custom sizes, materials and finishes</li><li>Single orders to large project supply</li><li>Direct technical support from enquiry to delivery</li></ul></div></div>\n<h2>What We Manufacture</h2><p>Our range covers the products needed to distribute and control air in a ducted air-conditioning or ventilation system:</p>\n<div class=\"about-list\"><div><h3>Grills</h3><p>Return air, supply air, linear, stripline, double deflection, door grills and more.</p></div><div><h3>Diffusers</h3><p>Slot, round, square, tile and four-way diffusers in aluminium and stainless steel.</p></div><div><h3>Dampers</h3><p>Volume control, collar, gravity, round, capsule, butterfly and motorised dampers.</p></div><div><h3>Disk Valves</h3><p>Metal and plastic disk valves for exhaust and supply in toilets and small rooms.</p></div><div><h3>Jet Nozzles &amp; Louvers</h3><p>Long-throw jet nozzles and weather louvers for halls, plant rooms and facades.</p></div><div><h3>Special Items</h3><p>Fire and smoke panels, HEPA boxes, reducers, risers and grill doors.</p></div></div>\n<h2>Why Choose IndoGrills</h2>\n<div class=\"values\"><div><i>1</i><h3>Made to Your Size</h3><p>Every grill is made to the dimensions in your drawing, not forced into a standard size.</p></div><div><i>2</i><h3>Quality Finishing</h3><p>Powder coating, anodising and mill finish with consistent colour and clean edges.</p></div><div><i>3</i><h3>On-Time Delivery</h3><p>Planned production and dispatch so your site schedule does not slip.</p></div><div><i>4</i><h3>Local Support</h3><p>A Mumbai team that answers calls, visits when needed and sorts out issues quickly.</p></div></div>\n<h2>Where We Serve</h2><p>We are located in the Mumbai area and regularly supply projects in Mumbai, Navi Mumbai, Thane and nearby cities, as well as customers across Maharashtra and other states. If your project is outside the Mumbai region, send us your requirements and we will confirm delivery options.</p>\n<div class=\"about-cta\"><h2>Let\'s discuss your project</h2><p>Share your sizes, quantity and finish and we will respond with a quotation.</p><a class=\"btn\" href=\"https://indogrills.com/contact/\">Request a Quote</a> <a class=\"btn alt-dark\" href=\"https://indogrills.com/products/\">Browse Products</a></div>','About','','inherit','closed','closed','','6-revision-v1','','','2026-10-15 06:42:43','2026-10-15 06:42:43','',6,'https://indogrills.com/?p=216',0,'revision','',0),(217,0,'2026-10-15 06:50:24','2026-10-15 06:50:24','<div class=\"about-intro\"><span class=\"eyebrow dark\">About IndoGrills</span><h2>Manufacturing air distribution products for over 10 years</h2><p class=\"lead-text\">IndoGrills is a manufacturer of AC grills and air distribution products. With more than a decade of experience in the HVAC industry, we supply grills, diffusers, dampers, disk valves, jet nozzles and louvers to contractors, MEP consultants, builders and distributors.</p></div>\n<div class=\"about-stats\"><div><b>10+</b><span>Years of experience</span></div><div><b>50+</b><span>Products in our range</span></div><div><b>7</b><span>Product categories</span></div><div><b>100%</b><span>Made to order sizes</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"about-two\"><div><h2>Our Story</h2><p>IndoGrills began with a simple goal: to give HVAC contractors a dependable source for well-finished grills and diffusers, made to the size on the drawing and delivered when promised.</p><p>Over the last 10+ years we have grown from a small fabrication workshop into a manufacturer that supplies residential towers, commercial offices, hospitals, factories and retail spaces. Our growth has come from repeat customers, and we have kept the same approach throughout: accurate sizes, clean finishing and honest communication.</p></div><div class=\"about-card\"><h3>At a glance</h3><ul class=\"ticks\"><li>10+ years in HVAC air distribution</li><li>Custom sizes, materials and finishes</li><li>Single orders to large project supply</li><li>Powder coat, anodised and mill finishes</li><li>Direct technical support from enquiry to delivery</li></ul></div></div>\n<h2>What We Manufacture</h2><p>Our range covers the products needed to distribute and control air in a ducted air-conditioning or ventilation system:</p>\n<div class=\"about-list\"><div><h3>Grills</h3><p>Return air, supply air, linear, stripline, double deflection, door grills and more.</p></div><div><h3>Diffusers</h3><p>Slot, round, square, tile and four-way diffusers in aluminium and stainless steel.</p></div><div><h3>Dampers</h3><p>Volume control, collar, gravity, round, capsule, butterfly and motorised dampers.</p></div><div><h3>Disk Valves</h3><p>Metal and plastic disk valves for exhaust and supply in toilets and small rooms.</p></div><div><h3>Jet Nozzles &amp; Louvers</h3><p>Long-throw jet nozzles and weather louvers for halls, plant rooms and facades.</p></div><div><h3>Special Items</h3><p>Fire and smoke panels, HEPA boxes, reducers, risers and grill doors.</p></div></div>\n<h2>Why Choose IndoGrills</h2>\n<div class=\"values\"><div><i>1</i><h3>Made to Your Size</h3><p>Every grill is made to the dimensions in your drawing, not forced into a standard size.</p></div><div><i>2</i><h3>Quality Finishing</h3><p>Powder coating, anodising and mill finish with consistent colour and clean edges.</p></div><div><i>3</i><h3>On-Time Delivery</h3><p>Planned production and dispatch so your site schedule does not slip.</p></div><div><i>4</i><h3>Responsive Support</h3><p>A team that answers calls, understands drawings and sorts out issues quickly.</p></div></div>\n<h2>Supply &amp; Delivery</h2><p>We supply single pieces as well as full project quantities to contractors, consultants and distributors. Send us your requirements and we will confirm sizes, finishes, lead time and delivery options for your location.</p>\n<div class=\"about-cta\"><h2>Let\'s discuss your project</h2><p>Share your sizes, quantity and finish and we will respond with a quotation.</p><a class=\"btn\" href=\"https://indogrills.com/contact/\">Request a Quote</a> <a class=\"btn alt-dark\" href=\"https://indogrills.com/products/\">Browse Products</a></div>','About','IndoGrills is a manufacturer of AC grills, diffusers, dampers and HVAC air distribution products with 10+ years of experience. Custom sizes and bulk supply.','inherit','closed','closed','','6-revision-v1','','','2026-10-15 06:50:24','2026-10-15 06:50:24','',6,'https://indogrills.com/?p=217',0,'revision','',0),(218,0,'2026-10-15 06:50:24','2026-10-15 06:50:24','','Contact','Request a quote for AC grills, diffusers, dampers and HVAC air distribution products from IndoGrills. Share your sizes, quantity and finish and we will respond.','inherit','closed','closed','','7-revision-v1','','','2026-10-15 06:50:24','2026-10-15 06:50:24','',7,'https://indogrills.com/?p=218',0,'revision','',0),(219,0,'2026-10-15 06:56:57','2026-10-15 06:56:57','<div class=\"about-intro\"><span class=\"eyebrow dark\">About IndoGrills</span><h2>Manufacturing air distribution products for over 10 years</h2><p class=\"lead-text\">IndoGrills is a manufacturer of AC grills and air distribution prod