ooms.</p></div><div><h3>Jet Nozzles &amp; Louvers</h3><p>Long-throw jet nozzles and weather louvers for halls, plant rooms and facades.</p></div><div><h3>Special Items</h3><p>Fire and smoke panels, HEPA boxes, reducers, risers and grill doors.</p></div></div>\n<h2>Why Choose IndoGrills</h2>\n<div class=\"values\"><div><i>1</i><h3>Made to Your Size</h3><p>Every grill is made to the dimensions in your drawing, not forced into a standard size.</p></div><div><i>2</i><h3>Quality Finishing</h3><p>Powder coating, anodising and mill finish with consistent colour and clean edges.</p></div><div><i>3</i><h3>On-Time Delivery</h3><p>Planned production and dispatch so your site schedule does not slip.</p></div><div><i>4</i><h3>Responsive Support</h3><p>A team that answers calls, understands drawings and sorts out issues quickly.</p></div></div>\n<h2>Supply &amp; Delivery</h2><p>We supply single pieces as well as full project quantities to contractors, consultants and distributors. Send us your requirements and we will confirm sizes, finishes, lead time and delivery options for your location.</p>\n<div class=\"about-cta\"><h2>Let\'s discuss your project</h2><p>Share your sizes, quantity and finish and we will respond with a quotation.</p><a class=\"btn\" href=\"https://indogrills.com/contact/\">Request a Quote</a> <a class=\"btn alt-dark\" href=\"https://indogrills.com/products/\">Browse Products</a></div>','About Us','IndoGrills is a manufacturer of AC grills, diffusers, dampers and HVAC air distribution products with 10+ years of experience. Custom sizes and bulk supply.','inherit','closed','closed','','6-revision-v1','','','2026-10-15 06:56:57','2026-10-15 06:56:57','',6,'https://indogrills.com/?p=219',0,'revision','',0);
